{"id":"b222ecc2b46013d7","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-savitch.md","title":"Savitch定理","display":"thm-savitch — Savitch定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-savitch","aliases":["29-thm-savitch"],"display":"thm-savitch — Savitch定理","depends_on":["[[29-df-resource-constructibility]]","[[29-df-complexity-classes]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem 2.32 and proof, pp.38–39, DjVu scans 53–54; constructibility p.26, scan 41","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；陈述及中点配置递归证明已核对","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-savitch"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-savitch</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-savitch — Savitch定理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1bf4bc889b65fb80\" href=\"?note=1bf4bc889b65fb80\" title=\"29-df-resource-constructibility\">29-df-resource-constructibility</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 2.32 and proof, pp.38–39, DjVu scans 53–54; constructibility p.26, scan 41"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；陈述及中点配置递归证明已核对"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NSPACE},\\mathrm{DSPACE},\\mathrm{PSPACE}\">\\(\\mathrm{NSPACE},\\mathrm{DSPACE},\\mathrm{PSPACE}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a>，所有分支停机、输入带只读；资源以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(\\cdot)\">\\(O(\\cdot)\\)</span> 计。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SpaceConstructible}\">\\(\\mathrm{SpaceConstructible}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1bf4bc889b65fb80\" href=\"?note=1bf4bc889b65fb80\" title=\"29-df-resource-constructibility\">29-df-resource-constructibility</a> 的内部形式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}savitch}\\vdash\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{SpaceConstructible}\\;\\Bigl(\\forall n\\geq2\\;s(n)\\geq\\lceil\\log_2n\\rceil\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{NSPACE}[s(n)]\\subseteq\\mathrm{DSPACE}[(s(n))^2]\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}savitch}\\vdash\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{SpaceConstructible}\\;\\Bigl(\\forall n\\geq2\\;s(n)\\geq\\lceil\\log_2n\\rceil\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{NSPACE}[s(n)]\\subseteq\\mathrm{DSPACE}[(s(n))^2]\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PSPACE}=\\bigcup_{k\\geq1}\\mathrm{NSPACE}[n^k]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PSPACE}=\\bigcup_{k\\geq1}\\mathrm{NSPACE}[n^k]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 2.32，印刷页 38–39、扫描页 53–54。已核对配置图路径的中点递归证明：递归深度为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(s(n))\">\\(O(s(n))\\)</span>，每层记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(s(n))\">\\(O(s(n))\\)</span> 位配置，故确定性空间为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(s(n)^2)\">\\(O(s(n)^2)\\)</span>。空间可构造性按原书定理显式列出；由多项式空间平方仍为多项式得到第二式。用显式非确定性空间并集替代未在上游定义的 NPSPACE 别名。</p>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-resource-constructibility","status":"resolved","id":"1bf4bc889b65fb80","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-resource-constructibility]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-complexity-classes","status":"resolved","id":"2017fdd1c0072445","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-complexity-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-complexity-classes","status":"resolved","id":"2017fdd1c0072445","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NSPACE},\\mathrm{DSPACE},\\mathrm{PSPACE}$ 见 [[29-df-complexity-classes]]，所有分支停机、输入带只读；资源以 $O(\\cdot)$ 计。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-resource-constructibility","status":"resolved","id":"1bf4bc889b65fb80","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SpaceConstructible}$ 取 [[29-df-resource-constructibility]] 的内部形式定义。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{NSPACE},\\mathrm{DSPACE},\\mathrm{PSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"O(\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SpaceConstructible}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}savitch}\\vdash\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{SpaceConstructible}\\;\\Bigl(\\forall n\\geq2\\;s(n)\\geq\\lceil\\log_2n\\rceil\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{NSPACE}[s(n)]\\subseteq\\mathrm{DSPACE}[(s(n))^2]\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PSPACE}=\\bigcup_{k\\geq1}\\mathrm{NSPACE}[n^k]","display":true},{"tex":"O(s(n))","display":false},{"tex":"O(s(n))","display":false},{"tex":"O(s(n)^2)","display":false}],"bytes":1928,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-thm-savitch]]、[[29-thm-space-hierarchy]]、[[29-thm-inclusion-chain]] — 空间与包含关系"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-222","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-savitch]]"}],"outgoing":["1bf4bc889b65fb80","2017fdd1c0072445"]}